    table (VSCommandTable.cto, keyed "Menus.ctmenu") into a managed resources
    container named "VSPackage" instead of the auto-generated "_EmptyResource".
    For a managed VSPackage, the shell resolves [$RootKey$\Menus] "Menus.ctmenu"
    through THIS package's VSPackage ResourceManager; the cto must live in a
    VSPackage(.<culture>).resources container, never in _EmptyResource.resources.
    Wired in the .csproj via <EmbeddedResource Include="VSPackage.resx">
    <MergeWithCTO>true</MergeWithCTO><ManifestResourceName>VSPackage</ManifestResourceName>.
  -->
